Article 1 The arbitration judicial review cases referred to in these Provisions include the following cases:
(1) cases applying for confirmation of the validity of an arbitration agreement;
(2) cases applying for setting aside of arbitral awards rendered by arbitration institutions in the mainland of China;
(3) cases applying for enforcement of arbitral awards rendered by arbitration institutions in the mainland of China;
(4) cases applying for recognition and enforcement of arbitral awards rendered in the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region, the Macao Special Administrative Region, and the Taiwan region;
(5) cases applying for recognition and enforcement of foreign arbitral awards;
(6) other arbitration judicial review cases.
